CORE
main.cpp
--cpp17
^\[main\.assertion\.1\] line \d+ call through binder: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.2\] line \d+ WRONG \(must FAIL\): FAILURE$
^VERIFICATION FAILED$
^EXIT=10$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
^warning: ignoring
^CONVERSION ERROR$
--
The function type of a candidate formed during deduction type-checked the
return type before the parameters, so call_binder's trailing return type
`decltype(Ret::call(obj, I...))' failed with "symbol 'obj' is unknown".
